card.statement:
For each $i,j \in \mathcal{I}_n$ and for $q \in \mathcal{I}_l$ such that $q \ge 0$,

\begin{align*}
\pr & \left( s_{i,j}
\left( \rdet
\begin{pmatrix}
e_{q+2,q} & e_{q+2,q+2} & e_{q+2,q+4} & \dots & e_{q+2,l-1} \\
1 & u_{q+2} & e_{q+2,q+4} & \dots & e_{q+2,l-1} \\
0 & 1 & u_{q+4} & \dots & e_{q+4,l-1} \\
\vdots & \vdots & \vdots & \ddots & \vdots \\
0 & 0 & 0 & \dots &  u_{l-1}
\end{pmatrix}
\right) \right) \\
&= (u+\rho_{q+2}-n) s_{i,j}(\rdet \Omega_{q+4,l-1}(u)) \\
&= (u+\rho_{q+2}-n) s_{i,j}(\rdet \bar\Omega_{q+4,l-1}(u)).
\end{align*}
